{"title":"CEMC CCC Problems and Solutions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problems_and_Solutions\">Problems and Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_CCC_Problems_and_Solutions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problems and Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Canadian_Computing_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Canadian Computing Competition\">CEMC Canadian Computing Competition</a> problems and solutions by test (1996-1999):\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_CEMC_CCC&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1996 CEMC CCC (page does not exist)\">1996 CEMC CCC</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_CEMC_CCC&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1997 CEMC CCC (page does not exist)\">1997 CEMC CCC</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_CCC&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1998 CEMC CCC (page does not exist)\">1998 CEMC CCC</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_CCC&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC CCC (page does not exist)\">1999 CEMC CCC</a></li></ul>\n<p>For later years, see <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_CCC_Junior_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"CEMC CCC Junior Problems and Solutions\">CEMC CCC Junior Problems and Solutions</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_CCC_Senior_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"CEMC CCC Senior Problems and Solutions\">CEMC CCC Senior Problems and Solutions</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018075030\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.011 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2/1000000\nPost‐expand include siz